{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_130_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_130","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春王正月，晉人滅赤狄甲氏及留吁。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_130_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_130","textTraditional":"二、夏，成周宣謝災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_130_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_130","textTraditional":"成周者何？東周也。宣謝者何？宣宮之謝也。何言乎成周宣謝災？樂器藏焉爾。成周宣謝災何以書？記災也。外災不書，此何以書？新周也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_130_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_130","textTraditional":"三、秋，郯伯姬來歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_130_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_130","textTraditional":"四、冬，大有年。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}